						 <p>SCP-069-J has received a major cleanup and update, along with a brand-new cover image.</p> <p>Also, just in case anyone hasn't figured it out yet:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">SPOILERS</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">GO&nbsp;AWAY</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>SCP-069-J came from a hilarious discussion on the #site19 IRC channel back in 2009, based on what a dating-sim based on the active site members would be like.</p> <p>The cast of SCP-069-J, some of whom are sadly no longer around, are as follows:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-590">SCP-590</a> (The Protagonist)</li> <li>Break (The Tsundere)</li> <li>Beatrice (The Athletic Genki Girl)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dr-mackenzie">Mackenzie</a> (The Yamato Nadesico)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dr-kondraki-s-personnel-file">Kondraki</a> (The Rival)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dr-gears-s-personnel-file">Gears</a> (The Principal)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dr-bright-s-personnel-file">Bright</a> (The Vice-Principal)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/agent-strelnikov-s-personnel-file">Waxx</a> (The Crazy Russian History Teacher)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/drclef-member-page">Clef</a> (The Creepy Stalker Teacher)</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dr-rights-personnel-file">Rights</a> (The Sexy Nurse)</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
